  "description": "The native payload for Agora's video quality analysis extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.7.0 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. Scores the outgoing video's perceptual quality so the engine can trade resolution against frame rate on the evidence rather than on bitrate alone. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS, not Net.Agora.Voice.iOS, which lacks a framework this one links — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is enabled by the engine itself once present in the RTC binding.",
